Wrote the native review to `docs/i18n/global-plan/reviews/native/th-a.md` (guidance pack + columns 001–009). No source files were edited.

**Verdict:** guidance pack **4/5**, columns **3/5**. Standard Central Thai, consistent. 001, 002, 004 and 007 are careful legal Thai (they already localise the reader as Thai). 003 Q16–Q20 and 008 fail on gender and advertising.

**Must-fix before a client sees it:** the bio that can be read as the attorney being ordered to pay TWD 1.57M; masculine **ผม** for Wei Tseng; “highest compensation” / typical 3–6 month sentences / high-severance success story / “contact anytime”; Korea tax and FX left as the working example; English **OUR TEAM** / **OFFICES**.

